# Accessibility (A11Y)

- **Keyboard reachable** — every interactive element supports Tab/Enter/Escape
- **All images have `alt`**; decorative images use `alt=""`
- **All form inputs have `<Label htmlFor>`** or `aria-label`
- **Color contrast ≥ 4.5:1** for body text
- **Semantic HTML first**, ARIA only when no native element fits
- **Focus visible** — never remove the focus ring without replacing it
